PPARM(1)                       ZOAU Command Syntax                      PPARM(1)

NAME

	pparm - Show the dynamic parmlib.

SYNOPSIS

	pparm [-dhv]

	-d
		Print out debug messages.

	-h
		Display syntax help.

	-v
		Print out verbose command information.

DESCRIPTION

	Show the dynamic parmlib.

EXIT VALUES

	0
		Success.

	Other
		Error, see message for details.

SEE ALSO

	pll(1), pproc(1)
